    "while the same six-second Zenith remains active. Replacing Arcane with Ice removes the old aura and",
    "stops Arcane payloads while direct damage and Ice still work. Wait out the native 45-second Zenith",
    "cooldown before replacement controls; resetting SpellCooldownMap does not clear its persistent ledger.",
    "Stored-healing detonation, Earth damage and client tooltips remain outside this activation repair."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
